5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I believe we need to be realistic about our operational capacity. I will look into the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I want to know where the time is actually being lost. I'll check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, and the journey audits on where minutes go.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
